# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Selenite Soul – Next.js Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development.
# On Vercel, add these in Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NODE ENVIRONMENT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EXTERNAL APIS USED BY THIS PROJECT
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# 1. OpenStreetMap Nominatim (City Search / Geocoding)
#    ▸ Used in: src/views/Kundali.tsx → geocodePlace(), searchIndianPlaces()
#    ▸ Endpoint: https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search
#    ▸ Authentication: NONE — public free API, no key needed
#    ▸ Rate limit: 1 request/sec (the app respects this via debounce)
#    ▸ Secret needed? NO
#
# 2. astronomy-engine (npm package — runs server-side, no external HTTP)
#    ▸ Used in: src/lib/astrology.ts
#    ▸ Computes sidereal planetary positions (VSOP87/ELP), houses, nakshatras
#    ▸ Authentication: NONE — pure JS calculation, no network requests
#    ▸ Secret needed? NO
#
# 3. geo-tz (npm package — runs server-side, no external HTTP)
#    ▸ Used in: src/lib/astrology.ts → resolveBirthInstant()
#    ▸ Resolves IANA timezone from lat/lon using embedded binary data files
#    ▸ Authentication: NONE — pure Node.js file reads, no network requests
#    ▸ Secret needed? NO
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FUTURE / OPTIONAL SECRETS (add if you integrate paid services)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Payment Gateway (e.g. Razorpay) – if you add real checkout:
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=

# Email provider (e.g. Resend) – if you add order confirmation emails:
# RESEND_API_KEY=

# Analytics (e.g. Vercel Analytics is free and requires no key):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
